seg-77d98b292f5f = Low-Earth-orbit (LEO) satellites pass fast and loud. The <c1/> kind follows one system through every stage: the signal, the pass and its link, the navigation message, and the fused position, velocity and time (PVT) fix and precise point positioning (PPP). Each stage hands its numbers to the next. See <a1><c2/></a1>.

