seg-e2c350772539 = The LEO PNT chain from a real run of leo-pnt-chain (leo-pnt-end-to-end.toml): the signal stage (generic-l at { "1191.795" } MHz, pilot tracked at { "10.23" } Mchip/s) hands to the pass stage ({ "1080" } km, tracked C/N0 peak { "58.2" } dB-Hz), which hands to the navigation message (kepler-rac, { "300" } s fit, representation SISRE { "0.91" } mm RMS, { "0.250" } m with orbit determination), which feeds the fused fix (GNSS only { "1.60" } m RMS 3D, GNSS plus LEO { "0.43" } m) and precise point positioning (convergence { "11.5" } min GNSS only, { "7.5" } min with { "240" } LEO satellites). { "11" } values are handed between stages.

