seg-5468515a5224 = The test and release flow: local gates (formatting, clippy, the no-attribution check, the doc-coverage ratchet, and scripts/gate.sh, which runs the full suite and repeat runs and writes the receipt the pre-push hook checks) lead to a CI-only pull request and a green full CI; the owner fast-forwards main to the green commit and an annotated tag lands on it after the version-sync check; the release workflow verifies the full suite on the tagged commit before anything is published, builds the binaries with an SBOM, checksums and build provenance, publishes to crates.io, PyPI, npm, the container registry, the MCP registry and the JetBrains Marketplace, polls every registry until it serves the new version, and dispatches the site build from the tag; a separate site-only path dispatches the pages workflow with the tag main and is refused unless nothing outside web/ and .github/ changed since the latest release

