seg-5841e4eac5a5 = The <b>GPS-denied alt-PNT</b> kinds navigate with no GNSS at all, matching a measured field sequence against a map through a particle filter. A <c1/> scenario flies a track through a spherical-harmonic gravity-anomaly field and recovers it from a cold-atom gravimeter's reading (<c2/>); a <c3/> scenario does the same against an SRTM elevation DEM (TERCOM/SITAN, <c4/>); and a <c5/> scenario fuses <b>gravity + IGRF magnetic + terrain</b> in one filter (<c6/>).

